# Cactusfolk Sureshot: "Reach. At the beginning of combat on your turn, other creatures you control with power 4 or greater gain
# trample and haste until end of turn." Turn 3: Bot1 casts Alpine Grizzly (4/2) and Hill Giant (3/3). At the beginning of combat
# the Grizzly gains trample and haste and attacks the turn it came; Hill Giant (power 3) gains neither and cannot attack; the
# Sureshot itself (not "other") and Bot2's Serra Angel (4/4, not Bot1's) gain nothing. Memnite blocks the Grizzly, and 3 of its 4
# damage tramples over. Turn 4: Bot2's beginning of combat is not Bot1's, and the keywords, gone at the end of turn 3, stay gone.

